%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: mcEnterWhiterun 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The trip to Whiterun has been pretty uneventful, thankfully.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418898
    - rid: 9079475089592287598
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: There were a few wolves, but they only attacked one at a time, which
      made it easy to protect myself.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I've been nibbling on a carrot, one of the vegetables Gerdur gave me,
      the whole way.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: While not really filling, it has helped me keep my strength up.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Ah, the stables.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418899
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Not much further now...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I make my way to the city gates...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: Halt! What business do you have in Whiterun?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Oh, that's right, the city's on lockdown...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: My name is {mc}, and I've been sent from Riverwood.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: Hmm? What for?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Did you happen to see some big black thing fly overhead around a-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hm. An hour or so ago?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: ... I wasn't just seeing things...?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: No, that was real.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: And it was a dragon. A dragon that burned down Helgen.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Riverwood is requesting aid in case it comes back.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: (... by the Nine...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: Quick, go in. The Jarl will want to hear about this.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The guard unlocks the city gate, and lets me inside.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418900
    - rid: 9079475089592287599
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: There's something different about actually being here in person.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: It feels... so much more alive.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: No weird NPC interactions, no constant noise pollution, no weird collisions
      between objects...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: And more than that, it feels <i>safe</i>.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Especially compared to what I've just been through...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I don't have time to enjoy this, I've got to head to the Cloud District.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Which I have been to, often! Just not in this life...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I make my way towards Dragonsreach.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I've arrived. The Jarl is arguing with his steward, as expected.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418901
    - rid: 9079475089592287600
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e66ba0c6207b7664dbb0b977115f10b2, type: 2}
    dialog: Who goes there? The Jarl was not expecting visitors...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832377
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: It's getting pretty tedious telling everyone my name and the exact same
      factoid...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: My name's {mc}, there was a dragon at Helgen, and Riverwood wants help.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e66ba0c6207b7664dbb0b977115f10b2, type: 2}
    dialog: There really was a dragon? Alright, the Jarl will want to speak with
      you.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Irileth leads me to the throne...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418902
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5301facf4ef9bfe46bdb4745494365d2, type: 2}
    dialog: So... what brings you to my court in these troubled times.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832380
    - rid: 9079474795981832381
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I'll cut to the chase, then.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You've heard reports of a dragon being sighted nearby?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5301facf4ef9bfe46bdb4745494365d2, type: 2}
    dialog: Aye... do you know something about that?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yes, I know a few things about that.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: First, that dragon is real and it burned down Helgen, which coincidentally
      freed Ulfric and me from Imperial capture.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Second, I have good reason to believe that the dragon is actually Alduin.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Third, Riverwood requests aid in the event of a dragon attack.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5301facf4ef9bfe46bdb4745494365d2, type: 2}
    dialog: Shor's bones! Alduin?!?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5301facf4ef9bfe46bdb4745494365d2, type: 2}
    dialog: Irileth, go dispatch the detachment to Riverwood, we can't afford to
      delay any longer.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e66ba0c6207b7664dbb0b977115f10b2, type: 2}
    dialog: At once, sir.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Irileth leaves Dragonsreach, presumably to do that thing Balgruuf just
      told her to.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832382
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5301facf4ef9bfe46bdb4745494365d2, type: 2}
    dialog: Dark times when the dragons shall return to Skyrim indeed...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5301facf4ef9bfe46bdb4745494365d2, type: 2}
    dialog: If Alduin really is here, we have to do something...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5301facf4ef9bfe46bdb4745494365d2, type: 2}
    dialog: Follow me, we must speak with my court wizard, Farengar.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Of course. Bleak Falls Barrow, here I come...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418903
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5301facf4ef9bfe46bdb4745494365d2, type: 2}
    dialog: Farengar!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832386
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a15860a01600501449a676d719ce3ca0, type: 2}
    dialog: Yes, my Jarl?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5301facf4ef9bfe46bdb4745494365d2, type: 2}
    dialog: It turns out that this... dragon situation is more serious than I thought.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5301facf4ef9bfe46bdb4745494365d2, type: 2}
    dialog: This person should be of help to you.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a15860a01600501449a676d719ce3ca0, type: 2}
    dialog: Really? Well then, I'm sure I can find something for you to do...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832394
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a15860a01600501449a676d719ce3ca0, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, I know...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a15860a01600501449a676d719ce3ca0, type: 2}
    dialog: I want you to go to Bleak Falls Barrow to-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Recover the Dragonstone, which is no doubt interred in the main chamber
      itself. Simplicity itself, I'm well aware.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a15860a01600501449a676d719ce3ca0, type: 2}
    dialog: ... how did you-?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Because, duh, of course you want me to go get the Dragonstone, it contains
      a map of dragon burial sites!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Very useful information if dragons are allegedly coming back, no?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a15860a01600501449a676d719ce3ca0, type: 2}
    dialog: You're a lot more knowledgeable in this subject than I thought you'd
      be...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Look, this isn't my first rodeo, I sort of know what's going on.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a15860a01600501449a676d719ce3ca0, type: 2}
    dialog: ... you do?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, so a thousand years ago, or something...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: During the time when Skyrim was ruled by dragons, the ancient Nords used
      an Elder Scroll to banish Alduin.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: And they technically succeeded.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: But, they didn't really banish him, they just sent him forward in time.
      Which is to say, today.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So, now Alduin's gathering his strength, resurrecting his fellow dragons,
      and plans on feeding on the souls in Sovngarde.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a15860a01600501449a676d719ce3ca0, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a15860a01600501449a676d719ce3ca0, type: 2}
    dialog: That's quite a tall tale...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, dingus, have you ever heard of Alduin's Wall?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a15860a01600501449a676d719ce3ca0, type: 2}
    dialog: I- I don't think so...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, it's an ancient Akaviri mural in Sky Haven Temple down in the Reach.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: It will confirm a chunk of my story.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a15860a01600501449a676d719ce3ca0, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I'll still get you the Dragonstone, it'd be useful to know where the
      dragons are buried, of course.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: U-um... Master Farengar, who are you speaking to-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832388
    - rid: 9079475089592287601
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832389
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri?!?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}, is that you?!?'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Yuri quickly approaches me, I assume she's excited to see a friendly
      face.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832391
    - rid: 9079474795981832392
    - rid: 9079475089592287602
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: She reaches out her arms, I guess for a hug, but quickly pulls them back.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832396
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: It's... nice to see you.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: It's nice to see you, too.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Although, it's kind of odd to see you here...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832397
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: What, you're a wizard's apprentice now?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, I woke up in the room back there...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Yuri points toward the room behind her, which should be Farengar's bedroom,
      if I remember correctly.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: And I was wearing this, so...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I k-kind of just assumed...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832398
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Of course you'd acclimate to living in Skyrim, heh...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Skyrim? Is that where we are?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832399
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Hmm... how best should I put this...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Since Yuri's about this sort of thing, I shouldn't need to make any sort
      of reductionist summaries for ease of understanding...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: The cosmological plane we're in is called Mundus, which is surrounded
      by Oblivion and Aetherius-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Another way to think of it is as a planet called Nirn.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Down the list, we're on the continent of Tamriel, in the northern province/region/nation
      of Skyrim.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Within Skyrim, we're in a centrally-located hold/duchy known as Whiterun.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'And, currently, we are in the capital building of that hold, called
      Dragonsreach. '
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Fascinating!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832400
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Yuri sounds somewhat giddy at my Unofficial Elder Scrolls Pages dump.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... I don't know if that's a good or bad thing.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: On the one hand, it's probably good to be happy in the new place we've
      found ourselves in.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: On the other, it'd probably put a damper on her spirits to head back
      home if she finally got to be in one of the stories she loves so much...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Anyway, if it wasn't already obvious, magic exists here.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832401
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Do you know how to wield it at all?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832402
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I don't think so... should I be able to?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Maybe? In the games that take place in this world, the player character
      always starts with a few spells that they can use...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Try spewing some fire out of your hands, or something.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, not to be rude {mc}, but how am I supposed to do that?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: By channeling magicka into your fingers?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Yuri tries to do... something? I don't think it worked, though...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832403
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Farengar, did you not teach this poor girl <i>anything</i>?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832404
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a15860a01600501449a676d719ce3ca0, type: 2}
    dialog: She should remember that the fundamental piece of channeling magicka
      is to draw out the aetherial energies from within...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832405
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Did that mean something to her?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Yuri focuses again, and successfully conjures a bound dagger.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832406
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: D-did I really just do that?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832407
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yep!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 'I put on my best Hagrid impression:'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You're a wizard, Yuri.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832408
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: That'll definitely be handy for where we're going.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Huh?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832409
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Didn't you hear? We're going to Bleak Falls Barrow.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Or, rather, I'm going and I'd like your help.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: U-um... where and what is that?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: It's an ancient Nordic burial ground on a mountain just south of here,
      we're going to get a funny lookin' rock.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Which is what me and Farengar were talking about, stay focused Yuri!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832410
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: S-sorry...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: It's whatever, I was just teasing you.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Anyway, it's pretty dangerous in there, so I would like your help.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832411
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: U-uhhh... dangerous how...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832412
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, there's bandits, draugr -which are basically zombies that don't
      want your brains, booby traps, and...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: And...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <Speed=1>... a giant spider...</Speed>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: All of that to say, I don't want to go in that place alone.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Um... Master Farengar... can I-?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a15860a01600501449a676d719ce3ca0, type: 2}
    dialog: Yes, yes, just go. You'd be more help to me getting the stone, anyway.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I guess we're adventuring buddies now~...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832413
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I don't appreciate the emphasis she put on that...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Now really isn't a good time for this chicanery! We still don't have
      a way home!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, sure.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Let's get going.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Of course, {mc}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832414
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So, uh, not to be that guy, <i>but</i>...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475089592287603
    - rid: 9079475098267418904
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Yes?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: How much money do you have?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}, that''s a very personal question-'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832417
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Then allow me to rephrase, how many gold coins do you have on you?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Wha-?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: ...!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832426
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, that's what you meant!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832418
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Let me see...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832419
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Yuri checks the various pouches she has on her belt.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: There's some alchemical ingredients...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: A handful of lockpicks...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: And-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, here's some...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Yuri starts counting the septims in her pouch.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I have around 145 gold coins, {mc}.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, so in total we've got around 200 of them.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: They're called septims, by the way.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh? Why's that?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832420
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Guh... here we go again...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, that's because the Third Cyrodillic Empire was founded-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d7d90acd337545242978d965e5b6e6f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Heeeeeeeey!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475089592287604
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Who's yelling at me in the middle of the day-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: '!!!'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832421
    - rid: 9079474795981832422
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Sayori wraps her arms around me, crushing my arms to my sides.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 'I manage to sputter out:'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: H-hi Sayori...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh... I'm sorry for squeezing you so hard, {mc}... I'm just happy to
      finally see you.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832423
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... I'm happy to see you too...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Wait, what do you mean finally?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, Monika said you'd be coming here a while ago, but we must have missed
      you on our way back from our adventure.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832427
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Wait, Monika's here too- and what do you mean <i>our</i> adventure-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori, you really shouldn't run off-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832428
    - rid: 9079474795981832429
    - rid: 9079474795981832430
    - rid: 9079474795981832432
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, hi {mc}!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832433
    - rid: 9079474795981832434
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: What, are you not happy to see us too, or something?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832435
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Th-that's not...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832437
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm just surprised that you're all-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Whatever. Follow me.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: We're going to talk at The Bannered Mare.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: The Bannered Mare?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832436
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, it's an inn/tavern here in town.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: That sounds good, {mc}. I could use some lunch.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832438
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The four of us make our way to The Bannered Mare.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474795981832439
    - rid: 9079474795981832440
    - rid: 9079474795981832441
